heard from her.","timestamp":"00:08:37"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Carmen Cruickshank","matched_calendar_invitee_email":"carmen@weddingindustryads.com"},"text":"So I don't know if I should like send a follow up email this week just to check.","timestamp":"00:08:40"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Whitney Hodges","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"Yeah, it doesn't hurt.","timestamp":"00:08:43"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Whitney Hodges","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"Um, and then for Ms.","timestamp":"00:08:47"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Whitney Hodges","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"Liz, he keeps bringing up that wedding wedding planner keyword.","timestamp":"00:08:50"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Carmen Cruickshank","matched_calendar_invitee_email":"carmen@weddingindustryads.com"},"text":"Um, but I don't know how big of deal that really is.","timestamp":"00:08:55"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Whitney Hodges","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"Maybe it's time to take it out.","timestamp":"00:08:58"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Whitney Hodges","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"But he's saying that it got spent like $38 this past week and didn't get any leads.","timestamp":"00:09:00"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Carmen Cruickshank","matched_calendar_invitee_email":"carmen@weddingindustryads.com"},"text":"Okay.","timestamp":"00:09:06"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Carmen Cruickshank","matched_calendar_invitee_email":"carmen@weddingindustryads.com"},"text":"I'll look at that and I'll possibly pause it.","timestamp":"00:09:07"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Whitney Hodges","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"Yeah.","timestamp":"00:09:10"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Whitney Hodges","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"And then the Ilya still has like a site link that has a 404 that needs to be changed, it looks like.","timestamp":"00:09:11"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Whitney Hodges","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"Like, and then, let's see, for the penny, he's got some suggestions on like some old actions, like making them not primary anymore, I guess.","timestamp":"00:09:21"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Whitney Hodges","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"For Carol Hall, is that just paused because she doesn't have her landing page ready yet?","timestamp":"00:09:43"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Whitney Hodges","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"Is that what's going on with that one?","timestamp":"00:09:48"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Carmen Cruickshank","matched_calendar_invitee_email":"carmen@weddingindustryads.com"},"text":"What was paused?","timestamp":"00:09:51"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Whitney Hodges","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"It says that you built a micro wedding venue ad group.","timestamp":"00:09:52"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Carmen Cruickshank","matched_calendar_invitee_email":"carmen@weddingindustryads.com"},"text":"Yes.","timestamp":"00:09:57"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Whitney Hodges","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"Yeah.","timestamp":"00:09:58"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Carmen Cruickshank","matched_calendar_invitee_email":"carmen@weddingindustryads.com"},"text":"Yeah, it's paused for.","timestamp":"00:09:58"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Carmen Cruickshank","matched_calendar_invitee_email":"carmen@weddingindustryads.com"},"text":"Or yeah, the landing page that she wants to build.","timestamp":"00:10:00"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Whitney Hodges","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"That's what I figured.","timestamp":"00:10:02"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Whitney Hodges","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"For Dogwood, I think that they've done everything that they need to do as far as advertiser verification.","timestamp":"00:10:07"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Whitney Hodges","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"tex