Whitney Hodges","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"So just to know just how things end up kind of like feeling on your end, right?","timestamp":"00:12:44"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Whitney Hodges","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"Once more is, is happening from there.","timestamp":"00:12:50"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Whitney Hodges","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"But I do think the way that we're like leveraging Victor at this point is.","timestamp":"00:12:53"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Whitney Hodges","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"I love to see you like asking, just like checking in with him and like asking what needs to be done.","timestamp":"00:13:00"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Whitney Hodges","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"Hopefully that's like making your life easier too.","timestamp":"00:13:06"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Whitney Hodges","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"And we are still in the process of working with E2M on creating more of like something else, something that could function like Victor, but outside of Slack, if that makes sense, where it's more of like a dashboard sort of situation.","timestamp":"00:13:10"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Whitney Hodges","matched_calendar_invitee_email":null},"text":"So we'll keep you posted on that as it evolves.","timestamp":"00:13:28"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Carmen Cruickshank","matched_calendar_invitee_email":"carmen@weddingindustryads.com"},"text":"That's good.","timestamp":"00:13:33"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Carmen Cruickshank","matched_calendar_invitee_email":"carmen@weddingindustryads.com"},"text":"Yeah.","timestamp":"00:13:34"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Carmen Cruickshank","matched_calendar_invitee_email":"carmen@weddingindustryads.com"},"text":"That's exciting to see like how the agency is evolving and stuff.","timestamp":"00:13:35"},{"speaker":{"display_name":"Carmen Cruickshank","matched_calen